abstract: >
  A public archive of research, governance frameworks, AI system architectures,
  and constitutional substrates developed through the Aetherforge initiative.
  Includes Aluminum OS (constitutional substrate for regenerative computing),
  GPTBrain agent scaffolding, council governance records, and allied projects
  spanning financial sovereignty, aerospace policy, and agentic autonomy.
